From 59af245a90571d309e020bad984b37ff72523b81 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ananya Sridhar <ananyasridhar108@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 09:06:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] COPPA: verifiable parental consent gate on self-serve kid
 signup

POST /auth/kid-register now requires a recently-verified parent email
(via the existing /verify/request + /verify/confirm OTP flow) before it
will create an account. Reuses EmailVerification rather than a second
system; adds verified_at so consent checks can enforce a 30-minute
recency window instead of treating any past verification as permanent.

New migration c3d4e5f6a7b8, chained on b2c3d4e5f6a7 (the now-merged
kid-login throttle table) -- single clean head, alembic history/heads
both confirm it.
